  "body": "Supports #1478 \r\n\r\nI've put quite a lot of work into this PR.  But, now I think we need to reconsider how we manage perceptions, including:\r\n- `<AssetIcon>` should not use css styles for the icon color & image, the values of color and icon should come from the wargame document\r\n- perception data should be passed via the color shade and icon URL\r\n\r\nOnce the above changes are made, the changes for perception should probably be started from fresh",
